# CareRoute AI Environment Configuration

# 1. Google Gemini API (Required for live AI reasoning and bilingual explanations)
# Get your free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Supabase PostgreSQL & Auth (Required for persistent production storage)
# Create a free project at: https://supabase.com/
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_supabase_service_role_key_here

# Note: If no API keys are provided, CareRoute AI automatically runs in complete
# Hackathon Demonstration Mode with rich, clinically verified synthetic patient records.
